--- PARITY MAP (web FSMHealthPanel.tsx -> native) ---
States (all render): loading -> skeleton chrome; empty -> the web `alerts.length===0`
  GREEN "all clear" healthy row; error -> QueryError peer + retry; data -> alert grid.
  Plus the P4 leaf freshness axis: live/stale/offline chip + banner + one-shot stale auto-refresh.
Analyses (ported verbatim from the web useMemo):
  * Flapping: group by fsm_name (insertion order), sorted asc, sliding 60s window;
    >5 same-FSM transitions in a window flags them. Panel alert count = flapped-set size
    FROZEN at the first FSM type that flaps (web pushes the alert once). `computeFlapIds`
    exported = FULL set across every type.
  * Stuck: latest state per `${fsm_name}:${vehicle_id}` for drive_session/charge_session,
    counted when in pending/active and age > 4h (injected `now` for determinism).
  * Recovery: count of transitions whose to_state == "recovered".
i18n keys (table FSMHealthPanel): fsm.health.{title,allClear,flapTitle,stuckTitle,
  recoveryTitle,flapping,stuck,recoveries} + native chrome fsmHealth.{live,stale,offline,
  staleBanner,offlineBanner,refresh,loadingA11y,errorTitle,retry}.
Telemetry (P1/S11): model.start() emits `view.opened surface=FSMHealthPanel`.
Accessibility: header trait .isHeader; refresh button labelled; alert cards combine into a
  spoken "{title}, {message}"; icons accessibilityHidden; ViewThatFits reflows for Dynamic Type.

